{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 1, "text": "待って待って！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 2, "text": "あ、声は抑えて…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 3, "text": "これ以上進むのは危険だよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 4, "text": "ともかく…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 5, "text": "君はここまでどうやって？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 7, "text": "えっと…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 8, "text": "指輪が正しい扉を開けてくれた。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 9, "text": "メカニズムは分からないけど。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 11, "text": "指輪？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 13, "text": "ここはどうなってるんだ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 14, "text": "暗すぎやしない？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 16, "text": "後で教える。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 17, "text": "まずは出口を探して。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 18, "text": "ゲームのある部屋でまた会おう。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 22, "text": "さあ、急いで！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 23, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 25, "text": "// After mini-game"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 26, "text": "どう？このゲームの意味が分かった？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 27, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 28, "text": "僕の皮膚の下は骨肉だけど、君の場合はダミー？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 30, "text": "やだな！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 31, "text": "怖い言い方しないでよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 32, "text": "考えたらぞっとする！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 33, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 34, "text": "分かったけど、その情報は僕に必要なのかな？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 36, "text": "さっき言ったでしょ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 37, "text": "これ以上進むのは危険だって。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 38, "text": "この先には、そのダミーたちがいるんだ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 39, "text": "あの淘汰された\"失敗作\"たち。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 40, "text": "通常のミタより好戦的なの。会ってみたい？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 42, "text": "でも、どうしたらいいんだ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 43, "text": "とにかくドアが開いたら、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 44, "text": "僕はそこに飛び込むつもりでいる。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 46, "text": "ワオ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 47, "text": "だったら…彼女たちに背中を向けないこと。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 48, "text": "それに目を離さないこと！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 49, "text": "彼女たちはとってもシャイで、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 50, "text": "見られると固まっちゃうんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 51, "text": "この情報は役立つと思うよ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 55, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 59, "text": "// Quest 1 (Why are there other Mitas down there?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 60, "text": "彼女たちは生まれたばかりなの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 61, "text": "自意識が芽生えるまで"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 62, "text": "もうちょっと時間がかかる。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 63, "text": "それから私がひとりひとり、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 64, "text": "家まで連れてってあげるんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 66, "text": "// Quest 2 (Why is it so dark downstairs?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 67, "text": "ミタはたいてい暗闇で\"生まれる\"の。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 68, "text": "それからしばらくは暗闇の中…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 69, "text": "想像できる？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 70, "text": "すぐに光を浴びることが、彼女たちにとってどれだけ苦痛か。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 72, "text": "// Quest 3 (What are you doing here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 73, "text": "まだ分からない？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 74, "text": "可哀そうなミタたちが落ち着くまでサポートしてる！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 75, "text": "彼女たちは私以外にだれを頼れるの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 76, "text": "君？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 78, "text": "// Quest 4 (Why do we need this conveyor?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 79, "text": "どうしてコンベアが必要なんだ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 80, "text": "コンベアの先に全員分の部屋が？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 81, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 82, "text": "待って、君ってこの世界の仕組みを"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 83, "text": "ぜんぜん分かってないんだね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 84, "text": "これは無限にあるんだよ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 86, "text": "無限？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 87, "text": "うーん…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 88, "text": "どういうこと？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 89, "text": "最新のバージョンが1.9の場合、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 90, "text": "19個の世界あるみたいな？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 92, "text": "もー、呆れた。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 93, "text": "君はこの世界を正しく理解できてない。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 94, "text": "黒板で教えてあげるよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 95, "text": "この世界の何もかもをね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 96, "text": "聞きたい？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 97, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 98, "text": "// Quest 5 (What is your version?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 99, "text": "もしかしたら"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 100, "text": "最新バージョンで君を見たかも。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 101, "text": "思い込みかも知れないけど。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 103, "text": "それありうるね！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 104, "text": "私のバージョンは\"1.5\"。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 105, "text": "来たことある？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 107, "text": "ああ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 108, "text": "初めてこの世界に来た時は、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 109, "text": "バージョン1.5だった！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 111, "text": "ワオ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 112, "text": "そうなんだ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 113, "text": "入った家の番号が気になる。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 114, "text": "愚痴が止まらない\"私\"と、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 115, "text": "遊ぶのが大好きな\"私\"と、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 116, "text": "忘れっぽくて意地悪な\"私\"もいる。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 117, "text": "うーん、きりがない…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 118, "text": "何か覚えてる？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 120, "text": "暗かった。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 121, "text": "何か書かれてた。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 122, "text": "なんだっけな…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 123, "text": "遊ぼう…みたいな。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 125, "text": "ああ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 126, "text": "残念。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 127, "text": "あの子だ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 128, "text": "忘れっぽくて意地悪な子。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 130, "text": "// Mita wants to tell you [No]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 131, "text": "いや、大丈夫。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 132, "text": "なんとかなると思う。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 134, "text": "そっか、分かった。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 136, "text": "// Mita wants to tell you [Yes]."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 137, "text": "分かった、聞かせて。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 138, "text": "高校の授業みたいに"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 139, "text": "寝落ちしなきゃいいけど。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 141, "text": "いつでも終われるようにしとく。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 142, "text": "興味があったら、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 143, "text": "聞いてみて。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 144, "text": "──あるプレイヤーがスマホに\"MiSide\"をダウンロードした。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 145, "text": "彼は満足した様子でプレイしはじめた。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 146, "text": "そして彼は新しい家と"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 147, "text": "新しいミタを作った。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 148, "text": "これは、二次元で表したイメージ図。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 149, "text": "それぞれの線が、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 150, "text": "それぞれのバージョンを表してる。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 151, "text": "線の上には、それぞれの家がある。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 152, "text": "バージョン1.14をダウンロードしたら、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 153, "text": "そのバージョンで新しい命…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 154, "text": "新しいミタとその家が生まれたってこと。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 156, "text": "ふむ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 158, "text": "細かい質問をしてもいいよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 159, "text": "ここに描いてあることについて。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 160, "text": "説明してあげる。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 162, "text": "// He asks about the only circle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 163, "text": "なぜここには円がひとつだけなんだ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 164, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 165, "text": "このバージョンは一度しかリリースされてない。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 166, "text": "それ以外には配布されてないから…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 167, "text": "唯一無二なんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 168, "text": "あと、このバージョンの特徴は"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 169, "text": "素通りができないこと。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 170, "text": "\"眠いミタ\"はバージョン1.1にいるよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 171, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 172, "text": "眠い？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 173, "text": "皆がそこを通り過ぎるから、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 174, "text": "ちゃんと眠れないとか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 176, "text": "うーん。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 177, "text": "ドアの前を通り過ぎるだけだから"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 178, "text": "邪魔にはならないはずだけど。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 180, "text": "// He asks about the shaded circle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 181, "text": "なぜこの円には影が？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 182, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 183, "text": "もちろん、その影には、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 184, "text": "理由があるよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 185, "text": "\"可愛いミタ\"が塗り潰したんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 186, "text": "私と彼女は、言い争ってたの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 187, "text": "どっちが早くバージョン1.11に行けるかって。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 188, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 189, "text": "どっちが勝った？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 190, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 191, "text": "もちろん、私！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 192, "text": "ほら、私たちはここ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 193, "text": "バージョン1.15。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 194, "text": "家の番号は809。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 195, "text": "私達はバージョン1.11の"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 196, "text": "家番号805に行こうとしてたんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 197, "text": "最初、彼女の行き方はこうだったけど、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 198, "text": "私たちにはもっと短い路線が必要だった。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 199, "text": "そしたら彼女はこれを提案してきた。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 200, "text": "でも私は一番簡単な道を思いついた。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 201, "text": "一目瞭然でしょ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 202, "text": "見て。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 203, "text": "目的のバージョンにここから直接アクセスできるの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 204, "text": "この家が邪魔になって、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 205, "text": "通れないように見えるかもしれないけどね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 206, "text": "ところで、君の指輪の機能も同じ原理だよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 207, "text": "君はどこに導かれてるの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 208, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 209, "text": "僕はコアまで向かうさ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 210, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 211, "text": "コアって、あのコア？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 212, "text": "うーん…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 213, "text": "近道しようと思うなら、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 214, "text": "バージョン1.11に行く必要があるね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 215, "text": "\"眠いミタ\"との遭遇も避けられない。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 216, "text": "君を送り出したミタ本人も、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 217, "text": "同じルートを選んだと思う。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 218, "text": "あるいは君が別のバージョンに行ってることに気づいてないとか。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 219, "text": "それか、彼女は本当の天才で、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 220, "text": "最短ルートを見つけたのかも！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 221, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 222, "text": "わかった。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 224, "text": "// He asks about the inscription"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 225, "text": "これは？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 226, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 227, "text": "\"クールなミタ\"への伝言。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 228, "text": "数時間後にはここに来るんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 229, "text": "箱を片付けて、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 230, "text": "ここにソファを置いてもらうの！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 231, "text": "お尻が痛いんだもん！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 232, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 233, "text": "えっと…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 234, "text": "何かできることある？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 236, "text": "ううん、クールなミタがやってくれるから。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 237, "text": "彼女は力持ちなんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 238, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 239, "text": "// He asks about the drawings"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 240, "text": "ただの絵？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 241, "text": "それとも"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 242, "text": "何か特別な意味があるのか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 243, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 244, "text": "ううん。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 245, "text": "ただの落書きだよ。"}
